      "translatedText": "1. **Serial lower\\-level protocol driver**  \n   The Linux host reads odom sent by STM32 via the Asio serial port and sends cmd_vel\\.\n\n2. **TCP debug server**  \n   Write a TCP server so that a phone or computer can connect over the network and send debug commands to control the car\\.\n\n3. **UDP heartbeat and status broadcast**  \n   The car broadcasts its own status once per second, and the debugging tool automatically discovers the device\\.",
